[["Map",1,2,9,10,135,136],"meta::meta",["Map",3,4,5,6,7,8],"astro-version","5.17.3","content-config-digest","bd5550f70587b0fd","astro-config-digest","{\"root\":{},\"srcDir\":{},\"publicDir\":{},\"outDir\":{},\"cacheDir\":{},\"site\":\"https://amgflooring.us\",\"compressHTML\":true,\"base\":\"/\",\"trailingSlash\":\"ignore\",\"output\":\"static\",\"scopedStyleStrategy\":\"attribute\",\"build\":{\"format\":\"directory\",\"client\":{},\"server\":{},\"assets\":\"_astro\",\"serverEntry\":\"index.js\",\"redirects\":false,\"inlineStylesheets\":\"auto\",\"concurrency\":1},\"server\":{\"open\":false,\"host\":false,\"port\":4321,\"streaming\":true,\"allowedHosts\":[]},\"redirects\":{},\"image\":{\"endpoint\":{\"route\":\"/_image\"},\"service\":{\"entrypoint\":\"astro/assets/services/sharp\",\"config\":{}},\"domains\":[],\"remotePatterns\":[],\"responsiveStyles\":false},\"devToolbar\":{\"enabled\":true},\"markdown\":{\"syntaxHighlight\":{\"type\":\"shiki\",\"excludeLangs\":[\"math\"]},\"shikiConfig\":{\"langs\":[],\"langAlias\":{},\"theme\":\"github-dark\",\"themes\":{},\"wrap\":false,\"transformers\":[]},\"remarkPlugins\":[],\"rehypePlugins\":[],\"remarkRehype\":{},\"gfm\":true,\"smartypants\":true},\"security\":{\"checkOrigin\":true,\"allowedDomains\":[]},\"env\":{\"schema\":{},\"validateSecrets\":false},\"experimental\":{\"clientPrerender\":false,\"contentIntellisense\":false,\"headingIdCompat\":false,\"preserveScriptOrder\":false,\"liveContentCollections\":false,\"csp\":false,\"staticImportMetaEnv\":false,\"chromeDevtoolsWorkspace\":false,\"failOnPrerenderConflict\":false,\"svgo\":false},\"legacy\":{\"collections\":false},\"session\":{\"driver\":\"cloudflare-kv-binding\",\"options\":{\"binding\":\"SESSION\"}}}","services",["Map",11,12,35,36,60,61,83,84,109,110],"carpet",{"id":11,"data":13,"body":19,"filePath":20,"digest":21,"rendered":22,"legacyId":34},{"title":14,"description":15,"icon":16,"image":17,"order":18},"Carpet Installation","Plush, comfortable, and professionally installed carpets for bedrooms, living areas, and stairs. Transform your space with softness and style.","✂️","/images/services/carpet.png",4,"When comfort and warmth are your top priorities, nothing beats a high-quality carpet. At AMG Flooring LLC, we offer a vast selection of textures, patterns, and pile heights to suit any room's decor and foot traffic levels.\r\n\r\n### The AMG Difference\r\nA great carpet installation begins beneath the surface. We provide high-density, premium padding that extends the life of your carpet and maximizes underfoot comfort. Our precise seaming techniques ensure invisible joints, even in large rooms.\r\n\r\n- Huge selection of nylons, polyesters, and wool blends.\r\n- Professional power-stretching to prevent future wrinkles.\r\n- Pet-friendly and stain-resistant options available.\r\n- Custom stair runner installations.","src/content/services/carpet.md","1b1c485ed0fd1464",{"html":23,"metadata":24},"\u003Cp>When comfort and warmth are your top priorities, nothing beats a high-quality carpet. At AMG Flooring LLC, we offer a vast selection of textures, patterns, and pile heights to suit any room’s decor and foot traffic levels.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"the-amg-difference\">The AMG Difference\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>A great carpet installation begins beneath the surface. We provide high-density, premium padding that extends the life of your carpet and maximizes underfoot comfort. Our precise seaming techniques ensure invisible joints, even in large rooms.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Huge selection of nylons, polyesters, and wool blends.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Professional power-stretching to prevent future wrinkles.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Pet-friendly and stain-resistant options available.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Custom stair runner installations.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>",{"headings":25,"localImagePaths":30,"remoteImagePaths":31,"frontmatter":32,"imagePaths":33},[26],{"depth":27,"slug":28,"text":29},3,"the-amg-difference","The AMG Difference",[],[],{"title":14,"description":15,"icon":16,"order":18,"image":17},[],"carpet.md","bathroom",{"id":35,"data":37,"body":42,"filePath":43,"digest":44,"rendered":45,"legacyId":59},{"title":38,"description":39,"icon":40,"image":41,"order":27},"Bathroom Remodeling","Complete transformation of your bathroom space. From custom tile showers and heated floors to modern vanities, we bring your vision to reality.","🛁","/images/services/bathroom.png","Your bathroom should be a sanctuary. AMG Flooring LLC applies our high standards of precision from the floor up, offering comprehensive bathroom remodeling services in Northern Virginia.\r\n\r\n### Custom Tile Work\r\nOur master installers specialize in intricate tile designs, mosaics, large-format porcelain, and natural stone. We ensure perfect slopes in shower pans and flawless waterproofing systems (like Schluter-Kerdi) to protect your home.\r\n\r\n### Complete Renovations\r\nWe handle the entire process:\r\n- Demolition and careful removal of old fixtures.\r\n- Custom walk-in showers with niches and benches.\r\n- Radiant heated flooring systems.\r\n- Installation of vanities, mirrors, and fixtures.\r\n- Upgraded lighting and ventilation.\r\n\r\nTrust the 20+ years of expertise from Armend Gashi to build a bathroom that is as durable behind the walls as it is beautiful on the surface.","src/content/services/bathroom.md","30c77ffe0d4c3a34",{"html":46,"metadata":47},"\u003Cp>Your bathroom should be a sanctuary. AMG Flooring LLC applies our high standards of precision from the floor up, offering comprehensive bathroom remodeling services in Northern Virginia.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"custom-tile-work\">Custom Tile Work\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Our master installers specialize in intricate tile designs, mosaics, large-format porcelain, and natural stone. We ensure perfect slopes in shower pans and flawless waterproofing systems (like Schluter-Kerdi) to protect your home.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"complete-renovations\">Complete Renovations\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>We handle the entire process:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Demolition and careful removal of old fixtures.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Custom walk-in showers with niches and benches.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Radiant heated flooring systems.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Installation of vanities, mirrors, and fixtures.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Upgraded lighting and ventilation.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>Trust the 20+ years of expertise from Armend Gashi to build a bathroom that is as durable behind the walls as it is beautiful on the surface.\u003C/p>",{"headings":48,"localImagePaths":55,"remoteImagePaths":56,"frontmatter":57,"imagePaths":58},[49,52],{"depth":27,"slug":50,"text":51},"custom-tile-work","Custom Tile Work",{"depth":27,"slug":53,"text":54},"complete-renovations","Complete Renovations",[],[],{"title":38,"description":39,"icon":40,"order":27,"image":41},[],"bathroom.md","stairs",{"id":60,"data":62,"body":68,"filePath":69,"digest":70,"rendered":71,"legacyId":82},{"title":63,"description":64,"icon":65,"image":66,"order":67},"Stairs & Handrails","Custom staircase remodeling. We replace old carpet with solid hardwood treads, install elegant handrails, and upgrade balusters for a breathtaking entryway.","🪜","/images/services/stairs.png",5,"The staircase is often the centerpiece of your home's entryway. Upgrading from builder-grade carpet to a custom hardwood staircase makes an immediate, stunning impression.\r\n\r\n### Staircase Transformations\r\nAMG Flooring LLC specializes in complete staircase overhauls. We can match your existing hardwood floors perfectly, creating a seamless transition between levels.\r\n\r\n- **Solid Wood Treads:** Installation of durable, solid oak or maple treads.\r\n- **Custom Staining:** We match the stain of the stairs to your home's primary flooring.\r\n- **Baluster Upgrades:** Replacing dated wooden spindles with modern wrought iron balusters.\r\n- **Handrail Refinishing:** Sanding, staining, and securing wobbly handrails for safety and aesthetics.\r\n\r\nTrust our craftsmen to handle the intricate cuts and exacting angles required for professional stair work.","src/content/services/stairs.md","1b33bd25c3c1ff9c",{"html":72,"metadata":73},"\u003Cp>The staircase is often the centerpiece of your home’s entryway. Upgrading from builder-grade carpet to a custom hardwood staircase makes an immediate, stunning impression.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"staircase-transformations\">Staircase Transformations\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>AMG Flooring LLC specializes in complete staircase overhauls. We can match your existing hardwood floors perfectly, creating a seamless transition between levels.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Solid Wood Treads:\u003C/strong> Installation of durable, solid oak or maple treads.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Custom Staining:\u003C/strong> We match the stain of the stairs to your home’s primary flooring.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Baluster Upgrades:\u003C/strong> Replacing dated wooden spindles with modern wrought iron balusters.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Handrail Refinishing:\u003C/strong> Sanding, staining, and securing wobbly handrails for safety and aesthetics.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>Trust our craftsmen to handle the intricate cuts and exacting angles required for professional stair work.\u003C/p>",{"headings":74,"localImagePaths":78,"remoteImagePaths":79,"frontmatter":80,"imagePaths":81},[75],{"depth":27,"slug":76,"text":77},"staircase-transformations","Staircase Transformations",[],[],{"title":63,"description":64,"icon":65,"order":67,"image":66},[],"stairs.md","hardwood",{"id":83,"data":85,"body":91,"filePath":92,"digest":93,"rendered":94,"legacyId":108},{"title":86,"description":87,"icon":88,"image":89,"order":90},"Hardwood Floor Installation & Refinishing","Bring timeless elegance and natural beauty to your home with our premium hardwood services. We handle everything from new installations to dustless sanding and custom staining.","🪵","/images/services/hardwood.png",1,"Hardwood floors are an investment that adds lasting value and warmth to any property. At AMG Flooring LLC, we specialize in laying solid and engineered wood with precision.\r\n\r\n### Installation\r\nOur experienced team ensures proper subfloor preparation, moisture testing, and acclimatization of the wood before installation. We handle nailed, glued, and floating setups depending on your structural needs and material choice.\r\n\r\n### Sanding & Refinishing\r\nHas your original hardwood lost its luster? With 20+ years of experience, Armend Gashi and our team use top-tier equipment to sand away scratches, dents, and old finishes. We offer a wide range of custom stains and high-durability polyurethanes (water-based and oil-based) to bring your floors back to life.\r\n\r\n- **Dust containment systems** used during sanding.\r\n- Custom stain color consultations.\r\n- Repairs and board replacements for damaged areas.","src/content/services/hardwood.md","b734c958c658b577",{"html":95,"metadata":96},"\u003Cp>Hardwood floors are an investment that adds lasting value and warmth to any property. At AMG Flooring LLC, we specialize in laying solid and engineered wood with precision.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"installation\">Installation\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Our experienced team ensures proper subfloor preparation, moisture testing, and acclimatization of the wood before installation. We handle nailed, glued, and floating setups depending on your structural needs and material choice.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"sanding--refinishing\">Sanding &#x26; Refinishing\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Has your original hardwood lost its luster? With 20+ years of experience, Armend Gashi and our team use top-tier equipment to sand away scratches, dents, and old finishes. We offer a wide range of custom stains and high-durability polyurethanes (water-based and oil-based) to bring your floors back to life.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Dust containment systems\u003C/strong> used during sanding.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Custom stain color consultations.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Repairs and board replacements for damaged areas.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>",{"headings":97,"localImagePaths":104,"remoteImagePaths":105,"frontmatter":106,"imagePaths":107},[98,101],{"depth":27,"slug":99,"text":100},"installation","Installation",{"depth":27,"slug":102,"text":103},"sanding--refinishing","Sanding & Refinishing",[],[],{"title":86,"description":87,"icon":88,"order":90,"image":89},[],"hardwood.md","lvp",{"id":109,"data":111,"body":117,"filePath":118,"digest":119,"rendered":120,"legacyId":134},{"title":112,"description":113,"icon":114,"image":115,"order":116},"Luxury Vinyl Plank (LVP) & Tile (LVT)","Durable, waterproof, and surprisingly realistic. LVP and LVT are the modern choices for high-traffic homes and basements seeking luxury aesthetics without the maintenance.","📐","/images/services/lvp.png",2,"Vinyl flooring has evolved dramatically. Today's Luxury Vinyl Plank (LVP) and Tile (LVT) offer authentic wood and stone looks combined with unmatched durability.\r\n\r\n### Why Choose LVP/LVT?\r\nPerfect for active households, pet owners, and moisture-prone areas like basements, kitchens, and bathrooms. These modern materials are 100% waterproof and highly resistant to scratches and impacts.\r\n\r\n### Our Process\r\nWe begin with meticulous subfloor leveling—a critical step that many contractors rush. A flat subfloor ensures that the locking mechanisms of LVP do not break over time. Whether floating or glue-down, our installation guarantees a seamless, creak-free surface that will last for decades.\r\n\r\n- Vast selection of wood grains and stone textures.\r\n- Fast installation process minimizing disruption.\r\n- Easy to clean and maintain.","src/content/services/lvp.md","f39b482e6315c9f2",{"html":121,"metadata":122},"\u003Cp>Vinyl flooring has evolved dramatically. Today’s Luxury Vinyl Plank (LVP) and Tile (LVT) offer authentic wood and stone looks combined with unmatched durability.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"why-choose-lvplvt\">Why Choose LVP/LVT?\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Perfect for active households, pet owners, and moisture-prone areas like basements, kitchens, and bathrooms. These modern materials are 100% waterproof and highly resistant to scratches and impacts.\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"our-process\">Our Process\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>We begin with meticulous subfloor leveling—a critical step that many contractors rush. A flat subfloor ensures that the locking mechanisms of LVP do not break over time. Whether floating or glue-down, our installation guarantees a seamless, creak-free surface that will last for decades.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Vast selection of wood grains and stone textures.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Fast installation process minimizing disruption.\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Easy to clean and maintain.\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>",{"headings":123,"localImagePaths":130,"remoteImagePaths":131,"frontmatter":132,"imagePaths":133},[124,127],{"depth":27,"slug":125,"text":126},"why-choose-lvplvt","Why Choose LVP/LVT?",{"depth":27,"slug":128,"text":129},"our-process","Our Process",[],[],{"title":112,"description":113,"icon":114,"order":116,"image":115},[],"lvp.md","gallery",["Map",137,138,166,167,191,192,214,215,233,234,253,254,274,275,286,287,316,317,333,334,356,357,375,376,404,405,425,426,446,447,472,473,501,502,524,525,557,558,576,577,603,604,620,621,635,636],"bathrooms-1",{"id":137,"data":139,"filePath":164,"digest":165},{"group":140,"order":90,"coverImage":141,"images":142},"Bathrooms","/images/gallery/bathrooms-1/cover.jpg",[143,146,148,151,153,155,157,159,162],{"src":144,"alt":145},"/images/gallery/bathrooms-1/after-1.jpg","Finished result",{"src":147,"alt":145},"/images/gallery/bathrooms-1/after-2.jpg",{"src":149,"alt":150},"/images/gallery/bathrooms-1/before-after-2.jpg","Before and After comparison",{"src":152,"alt":145},"/images/gallery/bathrooms-1/after-3.jpg",{"src":154,"alt":150},"/images/gallery/bathrooms-1/before-after-3.jpg",{"s